Subject: [PATCH 1/6] feat(capture): add scheduler-owned prefix admission
 transactions

Pinned base: c757c4bb7c55d1eb69fdb2bdc6e6fb8507acb7a0. HS semantic source: e189be978c1bfb50c463e6fd080a52fd4d111922. Protocol v1 delays plan freeze until actual batch allocation and TP decisions complete; native receipts cover exact locks, COW, rows, token pages, state/tracking slots and nested budgets. Generic plugin control is dispatched on scheduler threads.

Validation: 17 pure CPU fault/collective contract cases and AST/diff checks passed. This is an integration checkpoint; actual scheduler, device allocator, numerical, hybrid and TP GPU acceptance are pending. GDN snapshot capability remains disabled until the follow-up precision patch.
